{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29913","headline":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪 · 李衢","name":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锡瑞来丰岁，旌贤入贡辰。\n轻摇梅共笑，飞褭柳知春。\n遶砌封琼屑，依阶喷玉尘。\n蜉蝣吟更古，科斗映还新。\n鹤毳迷难辨，冰壶鉴易真。\n因歌大君德，率舞咏陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李衢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}